    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the arena as a deadly <i>spinner</i> in <i><strong>Spinner</strong></i><strong>: Rogueblade</strong>, a fast-paced 3D\u00a0<strong>roguelike</strong>. <strong>Customize</strong> your <i>spinner</i>\u2019s parts and abilities, blaze through <strong>dynamic, realistic arenas</strong>, and shatter your enemies in a shower of <strong>sparks</strong> and<strong> </strong>steel.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/51edfcbc3872636cf36f6588ececa1d6.poster.avif?t=1755433495\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/51edfcbc3872636cf36f6588ececa1d6.webm?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/51edfcbc3872636cf36f6588ececa1d6.mp4?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique, every battle more intense than the last. Upgrade your <i>spinner</i> with powerful temporary abilities and permanent unlocks. Survive the chaos, master the spin, and climb through the ranks of ever-evolving destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure action, endless upgrades! Every battle pushes your limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Hardcore Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/1d2587c0621fac7329bd33815131361c.poster.avif?t=1755433495\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/1d2587c0621fac7329bd33815131361c.webm?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/1d2587c0621fac7329bd33815131361c.mp4?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intense clashes with realistic physics and visual effects. Knock back your enemies, wear them down through friction, and break spinners into pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Deep Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/300ec2ef05c5fff210d59c0bb839e213.poster.avif?t=1755433495\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/300ec2ef05c5fff210d59c0bb839e213.webm?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/300ec2ef05c5fff210d59c0bb839e213.mp4?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own spinner by customizing its body, blades, and tip. Create a unique battle top tailored to your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Realistic Visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/62350f907fbd844b06300d938560bef4.poster.avif?t=1755433495\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/62350f907fbd844b06300d938560bef4.webm?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/62350f907fbd844b06300d938560bef4.mp4?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter brutal roguelike arenas with high-quality graphics, immersive effects, and responsive sound design that bring every battle to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Interactive Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/26e065a5dc77c53a68ab7a635d8fac11.poster.avif?t=1755433495\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/26e065a5dc77c53a68ab7a635d8fac11.webm?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/26e065a5dc77c53a68ab7a635d8fac11.mp4?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in dynamic environments where snow melts, grass tears, soil crumbles, sand scatters, and glass shatters \u2014 all in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. Special Powers &amp; Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/5ae4da412ce7f2ccc9d04beda6a2b8ba.poster.avif?t=1755433495\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/5ae4da412ce7f2ccc9d04beda6a2b8ba.webm?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/5ae4da412ce7f2ccc9d04beda6a2b8ba.mp4?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spinners can unleash elemental abilities such as fire, sparks, or ice \u2014 and feature distinct traits like speed, strength, or durability depending on their structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6. Unique Spirits &amp; Bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/9fbe27bc0fe18c4696006eaacd72c42e.poster.avif?t=1755433495\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/9fbe27bc0fe18c4696006eaacd72c42e.webm?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/9fbe27bc0fe18c4696006eaacd72c42e.mp4?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss has a unique fighting style and spirit-based abilities. Unleash your own spinner's power to unlock powerful ultimates and dominate the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the arena as a deadly <i>spinner</i> in <i><strong>Spinner</strong></i><strong>: Rogueblade</strong>, a fast-paced 3D\u00a0<strong>roguelike</strong>. <strong>Customize</strong> your <i>spinner</i>\u2019s parts and abilities, blaze through <strong>dynamic, realistic arenas</strong>, and shatter your enemies in a shower of <strong>sparks</strong> and<strong> </strong>steel.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/51edfcbc3872636cf36f6588ececa1d6.poster.avif?t=1755433495\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/51edfcbc3872636cf36f6588ececa1d6.webm?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/51edfcbc3872636cf36f6588ececa1d6.mp4?t=1755433495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique, every battle more intense than the last. Upgrade your <i>spinner</i> with powerful temporary abilities and permanent unlocks. Survive the chaos, master the spin, and climb through the ranks of ever-evolving destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure action, endless upgrades! Every battle pushes your limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Hardcore Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/1d2587c0621fac7329bd33815131361c.poster.avif?t=1755433495\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/1d2587c0621fac7329bd33815131361c.webm?t=